  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The refracting angle of a prism is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and refractive index of the material of the prism is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>. Then the angle of minimum deviation will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know, angle of minimum deviation is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>"
  }
}